---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CtaStrip from '../components/CtaStrip.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
import { breadcrumbSchema, localBusinessSchema } from '../lib/schema';

const schema = [
  localBusinessSchema(),
  breadcrumbSchema([
    { name: 'Home', url: SITE.url },
    { name: 'About', url: `${SITE.url}/about/` },
  ]),
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About kianlocks — ABS-Only London Locksmith"
  description="kianlocks Ltd is a North & Central London locksmith fitting Avocet ABS 3-star high-security cylinders only. Independent, insured, accountable."
  schema={schema}
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'About' }]} />
      <h1>Built for one job. Done well.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        kianlocks Ltd is a London locksmith with a deliberately narrow
        offering: the lock change. Done with one cylinder, fitted by
        one team, to a single uncompromising standard.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <article class="prose">
        <h2>What we do</h2>
        <p>
          We replace the euro-profile cylinder on residential doors
          across North &amp; Central London with the Avocet ABS
          3-star Kitemarked cylinder. {SITE.price} flat —
          {SITE.priceIncludes} included. That is the entire service.
        </p>
        <p>
          When something goes wrong out of hours — locked out, a snapped
          cylinder, a door left insecure after a break-in — we run a 24/7
          emergency callout, quoted per job before we set off. We don&rsquo;t
          cut car keys, open safes, fit smart locks or carry alternate
          cylinder brands. If your job isn&rsquo;t ours, we&rsquo;ll say so
          and point you elsewhere.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we work with</h2>
        <p>
          Three customer types make up almost all our work:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Landlords</strong> changing locks between tenancies — old keys made worthless, insurance-grade cylinder fitted, itemised invoice for the property file.</li>
          <li><strong>Tenants</strong> who&rsquo;ve just moved into a new flat or house and want the previous occupant&rsquo;s keys to no longer open their door.</li>
          <li><strong>Homeowners</strong> upgrading a generic euro cylinder to a 3-star ABS — usually because the door looks vulnerable, the insurer asked, or you&rsquo;ve read about lock-snap attacks.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why this approach</h2>
        <p>
          The lock-change market in London is broken in a specific way.
          Too many callouts arrive unquoted, charge labour by the hour,
          and fit whatever cylinder is on the van — often one that only
          meets the standard when paired with a security handle the door
          doesn&rsquo;t have.
        </p>
        <p>
          The fix is not better marketing. It&rsquo;s a different product,
          a different process, and a different kind of conversation. We
          quote in advance, we fit a cylinder that meets the
          standard on its own, and we tell you exactly what you&rsquo;ve
          received in writing.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          kianlocks is the trading name of KIANLOCKS LTD, registered in
          England and Wales, company number
          <a href={SITE.companyHouseUrl} rel="noopener">{SITE.companyNumber}</a>,
          registered office {SITE.registeredOffice}. The company has traded
          as kianlocks since {SITE.tradingSince}. Our work is covered by
          public liability insurance; the certificate
          is available on request. Locksmithing is not a licensed trade in
          the UK, so we think you should ask any locksmith for these
          things — see <a href="/guides/how-to-choose-a-locksmith-london/">how
          to choose a locksmith in London</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>What we promise</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>{SITE.price} flat for planned bookings.</strong> Mon–Sat 9am–6pm. No callout fee, no per-minute labour, no upsell ladder.</li>
          <li><strong>24/7 emergency available — quoted per job.</strong> Out-of-hours or urgent work is priced separately so the standard fee stays standard. Email with EMERGENCY in the subject or call us.</li>
          <li><strong>One product.</strong> Avocet ABS 3-star Kitemarked cylinder, every job. We do not fit anything else.</li>
          <li><strong>Email-led booking.</strong> Reply within 2 hours during office hours.</li>
          <li><strong>Written documentation</strong> of every fitting — for your insurer, landlord file, or freeholder.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaStrip />
</BaseLayout>
